  // somewhere with no floor drawn under her (the black space around a map) or past its edge, she is sent
  // straight back to where she took off, the way the game returns her after falling into a hole (no damage).
  // A key ("Back to safe ground", U) does the same by hand if she ever ends up somewhere she can't get out of.
