  // =====================================================================================================
  // ---------- the Backroom ----------
  // Two more pages at Tara's pricey sandwich shop in Rookie Harbor (shop rookieHarborTara): the mod's own gear and food
  // (data/wdn-shop.json, added to the game's items at prestart). Gear grows with Lea and is very expensive,
  // but each piece has a patron medal: bronze takes 30% off, silver 60%, gold 85%. Food is locked until a
  // medal reaches a tier, then stays on sale for good. Three gear sets have set bonuses, two of them only
